# NOTICES

This package ships named colour presets whose values were extracted from
third-party editor themes. Every upstream is MIT licensed, and MIT asks for one
thing: keep the notice. This file is that notice.

The presets are an **excerpt, not a reproduction.** The originals assign colours
to dozens or hundreds of TextMate scopes; this package has eight token kinds, so
each preset carries the colours the original gave to the scopes matching those
eight, plus the background those colours were chosen against. They do not look
identical to the original editor.

No logo or wordmark of any project below is used, no theme name appears in this
package's own name, and this package is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by any of them.

