Backgrounds. Each preset also carries the editor background the original pairs
its foreground colours with, read from the same file and the same commit listed
above. The key is `editor.background` for every VS Code theme; for the two Atom
themes it is the less variable `@syntax-bg`, whose HSL is evaluated here the way
the foreground colours already were.

